In stratix10_rsu_probe(), error paths for COMMAND_RSU_DCMF_VERSION, COMMAND_RSU_DCMF_STATUS, COMMAND_RSU_MAX_RETRY, and COMMAND_RSU_GET_SPT_TABLE call stratix10_svc_free_channel() (which sets chan->scl to NULL) but do not return; they fall through to queue the next request on the same channel. The next service kthread that runs dereferences pdata->chan->scl in its receive callback path, triggering a NULL pointer dereference.

